    type: "input",
    question: "Un resistore da R = 50 Ω è attraversato da una corrente continua I = 0.2 A. Calcola la differenza di potenziale V ai suoi capi in Volt.",
    circuitSvg: "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 220\" class=\"circuit-diagram\">\n  <defs>\n    <pattern id=\"grid_5087\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\">\n      <circle cx=\"2\" cy=\"2\" r=\"1\" fill=\"#334155\" />\n    </pattern>\n  </defs>\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"220\" fill=\"#0f172a\" rx=\"8\" />\n  \n      <path d=\"M 60 110 L 140 110\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"3\"  fill=\"none\" />\n      \n    <path d=\"M 140 110 L 152 100 L 176 120 L 200 100 L 224 120 L 248 100 L 260 110\" stroke=\"#fbbf24\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n    <text x=\"200\" y=\"92\" fill=\"#fde047\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">R = 50 Ω</text>\n  \n      <path d=\"M 260 110 L 340 110\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"3\"  fill=\"none\" />\n      <polygon points=\"100,105 110,110 100,115\" fill=\"#34d399\" />\n      <text x=\"80\" y=\"95\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\">I = 0.2 A</text>\n      <circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"110\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#38bdf8\" /><text x=\"40\" y=\"115\" fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\">A</text>\n      <circle cx=\"340\" cy=\"110\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#38bdf8\" /><text x=\"355\" y=\"115\" fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\">B</text>\n      \n    <line x1=\"140\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"260\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#34d399\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\" />\n    <text x=\"210\" y=\"154\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\">V = ?</text>\n  \n    \n</svg>",
