    type: "choice",
    question: "Un doppio bipolo lineare ha matrice R: R₁₁ = 6 Ω, R₁₂ = 2 Ω, R₂₁ = 2 Ω, R₂₂ = 4 Ω. Se la porta 2 è a vuoto (I₂ = 0 A) e iniettiamo I₁ = 2 A, quanto vale V₁?",
    circuitSvg: "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 220\" class=\"circuit-diagram\">\n  <defs>\n    <pattern id=\"grid_82884\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\">\n      <circle cx=\"2\" cy=\"2\" r=\"1\" fill=\"#334155\" />\n    </pattern>\n  </defs>\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"220\" fill=\"#0f172a\" rx=\"8\" />\n  \n      <rect x=\"130\" y=\"60\" width=\"140\" height=\"100\" stroke=\"#a855f7\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\" rx=\"6\" />\n      <text x=\"200\" y=\"105\" fill=\"#c084fc\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">[R] Matrice</text>\n      <text x=\"200\" y=\"125\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">R₁₁=6, R₁₂=2</text>\n      <circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"80\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#38bdf8\" /><text x=\"45\" y=\"85\" fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\">+</text>\n      <path d=\"M 60 80 L 130 80\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"3\"  fill=\"none\" />\n      <path d=\"M 60 140 L 130 140\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"3\"  fill=\"none\" />\n      <circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"140\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" /><text x=\"45\" y=\"145\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\">−</text>\n      <text x=\"80\" y=\"70\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\">I₁ = 2A →</text>\n      <circle cx=\"340\" cy=\"80\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#38bdf8\" /><text x=\"350\" y=\"85\" fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\">+</text>\n      <path d=\"M 270 80 L 340 80\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"3\"  fill=\"none\" />\n      <path d=\"M 270 140 L 340 140\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"3\"  fill=\"none\" />\n      <circle cx=\"340\" cy=\"140\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" /><text x=\"350\" y=\"145\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\">−</text>\n      <text x=\"320\" y=\"70\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"12\">I₂ = 0</text>\n      <text x=\"50\" y=\"115\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\">V₁ ?</text>\n    \n</svg>",
    options: ["6 V","8 V","12 V","16 V"],
