    type: "choice",
    question: "Un circuito serie R-L ha una resistenza R = 6 Ω e una reattanza induttiva X_L = 8 Ω (Z = 6 + j8 Ω). Calcola il modulo dell'impedenza totale |Z|.",
    circuitSvg: "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 220\" class=\"circuit-diagram\">\n  <defs>\n    <pattern id=\"grid_29799\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\">\n      <circle cx=\"2\" cy=\"2\" r=\"1\" fill=\"#334155\" />\n    </pattern>\n  </defs>\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"220\" fill=\"#0f172a\" rx=\"8\" />\n  \n      \n    <circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"110\" r=\"18\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"#1e293b\" />\n    <path d=\"M 51 110 Q 55.5 103 60 110 T 69 110\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" fill=\"none\" />\n    <text x=\"32\" y=\"115\" fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"end\">e(t)</text>\n  \n      <path d=\"M 60 80 L 60 50 L 130 50\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"3\"  fill=\"none\" />\n      \n    <path d=\"M 130 50 L 136 40 L 148 60 L 160 40 L 172 60 L 184 40 L 190 50\" stroke=\"#fbbf24\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n    <text x=\"160\" y=\"32\" fill=\"#fde047\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">R = 6 Ω</text>\n  \n      <path d=\"M 190 50 L 230 50\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"3\"  fill=\"none\" />\n      \n    <path d=\"M 230 50 C 240 30 250 30 255 50 C 265 30 275 30 280 50 C 290 30 300 30 305 50\" stroke=\"#34d399\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\" />\n    <text x=\"268\" y=\"68\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">X_L = 8 Ω</text>\n  \n      <path d=\"M 305 50 L 340 50 L 340 160 L 60 160 L 60 130\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"3\"  fill=\"none\" />\n      <text x=\"200\" y=\"125\" fill=\"#fde047\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">|Z| = √(R² + X_L²)</text>\n    \n</svg>",
    options: ["10 Ω","12 Ω","14 Ω","48 Ω"],
    correctAnswer: "10 Ω",
    unit: "Ω",
    explanation: "\n      <strong>💡 Trucco mentale per la palestra:</strong><br>\n      • È la terna pitagorica moltiplicata per 2: <code>3-4-5 ➔ 6-8-10</code>!<br>\n      • <code>|Z| = √(6² + 8²) = √(36 + 64) = √100 = 10 Ω</code>.\n    "
