    subtopic: "Corrente di Fase con Neutro",
    type: "input",
    question: "Con tensione di fase costante Ef = 200 V e resistenza di fase R₁ = 10 Ω, calcola la corrente assorbita dalla prima fase I₁ in Ampere.",
    circuitSvg: "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 220\" class=\"circuit-diagram\">\n  <defs>\n    <pattern id=\"grid_4188\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\">\n      <circle cx=\"2\" cy=\"2\" r=\"1\" fill=\"#334155\" />\n    </pattern>\n  </defs>\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"220\" fill=\"#0f172a\" rx=\"8\" />\n  \n  <!-- Phase 1 of 4-wire system -->\n  <text x=\"40\" y=\"60\" fill=\"#f43f5e\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\">Fase 1</text>\n  <path d=\"M 90 55 L 130 55\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"3\"  fill=\"none\" />\n  <!-- Ammeter I1 -->\n  <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"55\" r=\"16\" stroke=\"#34d399\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"#1e293b\" />\n  <text x=\"150\" y=\"60\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">I₁=?</text>\n  <path d=\"M 170 55 L 210 55\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"3\"  fill=\"none\" />\n  \n    <path d=\"M 210 55 L 217 45 L 231 65 L 245 45 L 259 65 L 273 45 L 280 55\" stroke=\"#fbbf24\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n    <text x=\"245\" y=\"37\" fill=\"#fde047\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">R₁ = 10 Ω</text>\n  \n  <path d=\"M 280 55 L 320 55 L 320 155 L 90 155\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"3\"  fill=\"none\" />\n  <text x=\"40\" y=\"160\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\">Neutro N</text>\n  \n    <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\" />\n    <text x=\"80\" y=\"109\" fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\">Ef = 200 V</text>\n  \n  <rect x=\"110\" y=\"95\" width=\"180\" height=\"35\" stroke=\"#fde047\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\" rx=\"4\" />\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"117\" fill=\"#fde047\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">I₁ = Ef / R₁ = 200 / 10 = 20 A</text>\n\n</svg>",
