    question: "Durante la prova in corto circuito, una tensione ridotta V_cc = 10 V fa circolare la corrente nominale I_n = 5 A. Calcola il modulo dell'impedenza equivalente di cortocircuito Z_cc in Ohm.",
    circuitSvg: "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 220\" class=\"circuit-diagram\">\n  <defs>\n    <pattern id=\"grid_14420\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\">\n      <circle cx=\"2\" cy=\"2\" r=\"1\" fill=\"#334155\" />\n    </pattern>\n  </defs>\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"220\" fill=\"#0f172a\" rx=\"8\" />\n  \n  <!-- Short-circuit test circuit -->\n  \n    <circle cx=\"45\" cy=\"110\" r=\"18\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"#1e293b\" />\n    <path d=\"M 36 110 Q 40.5 103 45 110 T 54 110\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" fill=\"none\" />\n    <text x=\"17\" y=\"115\" fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"end\">V_cc</text>\n  \n  <path d=\"M 45 80 L 45 55 L 75 55\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"3\"  fill=\"none\" />\n  <circle cx=\"95\" cy=\"55\" r=\"16\" stroke=\"#34d399\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"#1e293b\" />\n  <text x=\"95\" y=\"60\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">I_n=5A</text>\n  <path d=\"M 115 55 L 140 55 L 140 75\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"3\"  fill=\"none\" />\n  \n    <path d=\"M 142 75 C 124 85 124 95 142 100 C 124 110 124 120 142 125 C 124 135 124 145 142 150\" stroke=\"#34d399\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\" />\n    <line x1=\"156\" y1=\"75\" x2=\"156\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" />\n    <line x1=\"164\" y1=\"75\" x2=\"164\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" />\n    <path d=\"M 178 75 C 196 85 196 95 178 100 C 196 110 196 120 178 125 C 196 135 196 145 178 150\" stroke=\"#34d399\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\" />\n    <text x=\"118\" y=\"115\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"end\">V_cc=10V</text>\n    <text x=\"202\" y=\"115\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\">Corto</text>\n  \n  <path d=\"M 140 145 L 140 165 L 45 165 L 45 130\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"3\"  fill=\"none\" />\n  <!-- Secondary short-circuit link -->\n  <path d=\"M 180 75 L 180 55 L 260 55 L 260 165 L 180 165 L 180 145\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"3\"  fill=\"none\" />\n  <rect x=\"250\" y=\"90\" width=\"20\" height=\"40\" stroke=\"#f43f5e\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"#f43f5e\" rx=\"2\" />\n  <text x=\"280\" y=\"115\" fill=\"#f87171\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\">Corto</text>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"200\" fill=\"#fde047\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Z_cc = V_cc / I_n = 10 V / 5 A = 2 Ω</text>\n\n</svg>",
    options: ["1 Ω","2 Ω","5 Ω","10 Ω"],
